title: "ai-idiolects: companion code for 'Beyond AI Language'"
abstract: >-
  Generation and analysis pipeline for a study of model-specific linguistic
  signatures in large language model output, comparing a 2024 cohort of six
  models against a 2026 cohort of six models on the same prompts.
